(7752931, 1281410, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Barroness:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, HaHa, what a wonderful dog. What type of dog is it, he/she is extremely cooperative? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks so much Debbi .. he''s a mini foxie .. its an australian breed .. very much like a fox terrier but smaller .. quite a convenient size actually .. !! .. ;)<br/>and re cooperative .. he''s pretty good at some things but not at others .. like coming when he''s called is a bit hit and miss .. he likes to do his own thing .. lol .. xx</td>', 'Originally posted by Barroness: Congrats, HaHa, what a wonderful dog. What type of dog is it, he/she is extremely cooperative?   thanks so much Debbi .. he''s a mini foxie .. its an australian breed .. very much like a fox terrier but smaller .. quite a convenient size actually .. !! .. ;)and re cooperative .. he''s pretty good at some things but not at others .. like coming when he''s called is a bit hit and miss .. he likes to do his own thing .. lol .. xx', '2023-07-03 15:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
